WEBVTT

00:00:05.663 --> 00:00:07.663
The highway exit
has to be somewhere.

00:00:07.823 --> 00:00:09.183
Where is it?

00:00:09.343 --> 00:00:11.383
VOICE BOX:
Meteor shower! Look out!

00:00:11.823 --> 00:00:12.903
Woody?

00:00:13.383 --> 00:00:14.943
Good work, inner voice.

00:00:15.423 --> 00:00:17.423
BO PEEP: So, how about you?
How's your new kid?

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.983
Bonnie?
Oh, she's great.

00:00:20.143 --> 00:00:21.183
Jessie is loving it.

00:00:21.343 --> 00:00:22.343
Jessie's still with you?

00:00:22.543 --> 00:00:24.583
Oh, yeah, the whole gang's
still together.

00:00:24.743 --> 00:00:26.223
Well, I mean, most of us.

00:00:28.663 --> 00:00:29.663
What about Rex?

00:00:29.823 --> 00:00:31.823
Yeah, yeah, Rex,
Bullseye, Slinky...

00:00:31.983 --> 00:00:33.663
-the Potato Heads...
-Buzz?

00:00:33.823 --> 00:00:34.903
Yeah, Buzz, too.

00:00:35.063 --> 00:00:37.863
I cannot wait to see his face
when he hears that I found...

00:00:38.023 --> 00:00:39.783
-Bo Peep? (LAUGHS)
-Buzz!

00:00:39.943 --> 00:00:41.583
-My old moving buddy!
-Buzz?

00:00:41.663 --> 00:00:42.743
It's so good to see you!

00:00:42.903 --> 00:00:43.983
Woody, it's Bo Peep!

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:45.783
-What are you doing here?
-What are you doing here?

00:00:45.863 --> 00:00:46.943
(GRUNTING)

00:00:47.063 --> 00:00:48.183
VOICE BOX:
Buzz... Buzz... Buzz...

00:00:48.263 --> 00:00:49.623
Buzz Lightyear to the rescue!

00:00:49.703 --> 00:00:51.063
-Three years!
-Three years!

00:00:51.223 --> 00:00:52.223
That's how long we've been

00:00:52.303 --> 00:00:53.503
hanging up there
waiting for a kid!

00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:54.663
Look, I'm sorry about that.

00:00:54.863 --> 00:00:56.703
You ruined our lives.
Shame on you!

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.463
-(DUCKY SOBBING)
-Who are these guys?

00:00:58.623 --> 00:01:00.303
-Lightyear promised us a kid.
-You did what?

00:01:00.463 --> 00:01:01.823
-I did not.
-(DUCKY AND BUNNY GRUNTING)

00:01:01.903 --> 00:01:03.503
BUZZ: Hey! Wait a minute!
DUCKY: Eat my plush!

00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:04.583
WOODY: All right now,
come on, stop it!

00:01:04.743 --> 00:01:05.743
Cut it out now!

00:01:05.903 --> 00:01:06.903
Come on, guys, break it up.

00:01:07.063 --> 00:01:08.063
Guys, I have a kid!

00:01:08.263 --> 00:01:10.383
(STUTTERS) You got a kid?

00:01:10.543 --> 00:01:11.543
Like a kid-kid?

00:01:11.703 --> 00:01:13.823
Like a human kid,
not a baby goat?

00:01:13.983 --> 00:01:15.943
Yeah. Now let go of Buzz
and come with me.

00:01:16.103 --> 00:01:17.183
I'll take you to Bonnie.

00:01:17.383 --> 00:01:18.743
-We're gettin' a kid?
-Yes!

00:01:18.823 --> 00:01:19.943
-We're gettin' a kid?
-(BOTH SINGING)

00:01:20.023 --> 00:01:21.863
-We're gonna get a kid
-Kid

00:01:21.943 --> 00:01:23.423
-We're getting a kid
-All right, let's go.

00:01:23.503 --> 00:01:24.943
-We gonna get something, oh
-We gonna uh, uh, uh

00:01:25.023 --> 00:01:27.223
-Where's Forky?
-(SIGHS) Long story.

00:01:27.383 --> 00:01:30.063
-(SINGING) Kid, we get a kid
-Kid, kid, kid

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:32.463
-We gonna kid
-We gonna kid, kid

00:01:34.503 --> 00:01:35.943
BONNIE: He's not anywhere.

00:01:36.423 --> 00:01:38.423
(CRYING) Forky's gone.

00:01:38.583 --> 00:01:40.103
Oh, honey, I'm sorry.

00:01:40.263 --> 00:01:42.703
Okay. Let's look outside
one more time.

00:01:42.863 --> 00:01:45.503
But then we have to keep
driving, okay?

00:01:47.383 --> 00:01:48.463
(DOOR CLOSES)

00:01:48.663 --> 00:01:50.103
They're about to leave!

00:01:50.263 --> 00:01:51.703
TRIXIE: Leaving?
HAMM: They can't do that!

00:01:51.783 --> 00:01:53.743
The panic is attacking me!
(SCREAMING)

00:01:53.823 --> 00:01:55.823
-Hey! Watch it, buddy!
-What do we do?

00:01:55.983 --> 00:01:57.343
-We have to stop them!
-How?

00:01:57.423 --> 00:01:59.943
We could frame Dad for
a crime so he goes to jail.

00:02:00.143 --> 00:02:02.503
Or go back in time and warn
Woody about the future.

00:02:02.663 --> 00:02:03.743
TRIXIE: That's crazy.
Time is a flat circle.

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:04.823
Jessie!

00:02:08.783 --> 00:02:10.183
BONNIE'S MOM:
I'm sorry, Bonnie.

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.263
We looked everywhere.

00:02:11.343 --> 00:02:12.583
But we need
to get going now, okay?

00:02:12.663 --> 00:02:13.983
Can we please leave a note
for Forky...

00:02:14.143 --> 00:02:15.583
so he knows where we're going?

00:02:15.743 --> 00:02:18.023
-He has to go to kindergarten.
-(TIRES DEFLATING)

00:02:18.143 --> 00:02:19.423
BONNIE'S DAD: Huh?

00:02:19.743 --> 00:02:20.863
(GROANS)

00:02:20.943 --> 00:02:22.943
Are you kidding me?
I can't...

00:02:23.663 --> 00:02:26.623
Everything is going perfect...
I just bought it. (GROWLS)

00:02:26.903 --> 00:02:28.663
BONNIE'S MOM: Okay! Daddy's
going to use some words.

00:02:28.743 --> 00:02:30.183
How about we go
to the carnival?

00:02:30.343 --> 00:02:32.983
Or maybe check out
some of those shops in town?

00:02:34.023 --> 00:02:35.423
(GASPS) What did you do?

00:02:35.583 --> 00:02:38.743
We're not going anywhere.
If you get my point.

00:02:38.903 --> 00:02:39.903
DOLLY: Brilliant!
REX: That was genius!

00:02:39.983 --> 00:02:40.983
HAMM: Nice work, Jessie!

00:02:41.183 --> 00:02:43.983
I'm sure Buzz and Woody are on
their way back right now.

00:02:46.303 --> 00:02:47.383
TOY: Whoa!

00:02:48.183 --> 00:02:49.623
Forky is in there?

00:02:49.703 --> 00:02:50.743
Yeah.

00:02:50.823 --> 00:02:52.143
Now, hold on.
I have a question.

00:02:52.303 --> 00:02:54.983
Who will Bonnie love more?
Ducky or me? Say me.

00:02:55.143 --> 00:02:56.583
-No, say Ducky. Ducky.
-Bunny. Bunny.

00:02:56.783 --> 00:02:57.743
Okay, guys.
Playtime is over.

00:02:57.943 --> 00:02:59.263
You have to follow my lead.

00:02:59.423 --> 00:03:01.983
We stay together,
we stay quiet. Are we clear?

00:03:02.143 --> 00:03:03.743
Absolutely.
Lead the way.

00:03:25.543 --> 00:03:26.863
-Are you kidding me?
-Move over.

00:03:26.943 --> 00:03:28.063
-You move over.
-Quit pushing me.

00:03:28.143 --> 00:03:29.383
-BUNNY: Stop.
-Shh!

00:03:29.463 --> 00:03:31.543
Oh, my maker!
That sheep has three heads!

00:03:31.623 --> 00:03:32.623
No, no, no!

00:03:32.703 --> 00:03:35.143
BUNNY: What? All six eyes
just looked into my soul.

00:03:35.303 --> 00:03:36.543
DUCKY: Gonna have nightmares.

00:03:41.463 --> 00:03:43.983
That's most likely where
your Forky is being kept.

00:03:44.863 --> 00:03:46.063
WOODY: All right,
this isn't so bad.

00:03:46.223 --> 00:03:48.183
We just can't be seen
by the dummies.

00:03:48.343 --> 00:03:49.663
Not just the dummies.

00:03:49.823 --> 00:03:53.223
Her cabinet is surrounded
by a moat of exposed aisle.

00:03:53.383 --> 00:03:55.623
GIGGLE: Where Dragon roams.

00:03:55.743 --> 00:03:56.823
(MEOWS)

00:03:56.903 --> 00:03:58.063
-We can handle a cat.
-No.

00:03:58.223 --> 00:03:59.503
Not this one.

00:04:00.903 --> 00:04:01.903
(ALL GASP)

00:04:02.023 --> 00:04:03.023
(TOY SQUEAKS)

00:04:03.103 --> 00:04:05.783
Is that how we look
on the inside?

00:04:05.943 --> 00:04:08.223
There's so much...
(STAMMERS) fluff.

00:04:08.383 --> 00:04:09.583
So, how do you propose
we get up there?

00:04:09.743 --> 00:04:11.463
We could go straight across.

00:04:11.623 --> 00:04:13.303
-WOODY: How?
-That's quite a jump.

00:04:13.463 --> 00:04:15.343
We know the perfect toy
to help.

00:04:15.503 --> 00:04:16.743
BONNIE'S MOM:
Oh, Bonnie, check it out.

00:04:16.863 --> 00:04:18.583
-Look at all this cool stuff.
-WOODY: Bonnie?

00:04:19.023 --> 00:04:20.343
(GASPS) We gotta get
Forky now!

00:04:20.423 --> 00:04:21.703
Woody, don't...

00:04:21.903 --> 00:04:23.263
-Stick to the plan.
-10-4.

00:04:23.343 --> 00:04:25.063
-Follow me.
-Roger that.

00:04:29.023 --> 00:04:30.263
(GRUNTING)

00:04:30.343 --> 00:04:32.823
Woody just sits in the closet?
With no playtime?

00:04:32.983 --> 00:04:35.183
Yeah, he told me himself,
he's useless.

00:04:35.343 --> 00:04:36.463
That's awful.

00:04:36.623 --> 00:04:37.903
Such pretty hair...

00:04:38.543 --> 00:04:39.663
What are you doing?

00:04:39.823 --> 00:04:40.903
You need to stick to the plan.

00:04:41.063 --> 00:04:42.543
But it's Bonnie.
She's right...

00:04:42.703 --> 00:04:44.223
BONNIE: Can we go
to the carnival, too?

00:04:44.383 --> 00:04:45.383
...there.

00:04:45.463 --> 00:04:47.463
Come on. Stay quiet.

00:04:47.623 --> 00:04:49.183
You better hope
the dummies didn't...

00:04:49.263 --> 00:04:50.383
(WOODY GASPS)

00:04:51.703 --> 00:04:52.703
(BO PEEP GRUNTS)

00:04:52.783 --> 00:04:54.063
Whoa!

00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:03.063
-(BLEATING)
-(GROANS)

00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:04.303
(GRUNTS)

00:05:05.783 --> 00:05:07.263
-(BELL DINGS)
-(GASPS)

